{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Hensel 化"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Hensel化"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>局部环</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"局部环","text":"局部环"}},{"Plain":"的 <strong>Hensel 化</strong>是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hensel环","text":"Hensel 环"}},{"Plain":"的范畴到局部环的范畴的含入的左"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>设 $R$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"离散赋值环","text":"离散赋值环"}},{"Plain":", 其分式域为 $K$, 极大理想为 $\\mathfrak m$. 记\n$$\r\n\\widehat R = \\operatorname{lim}_n R/\\mathfrak m^n\r\n$$\n为 $R$ 的 $\\mathfrak m$-进"},{"Local":{"url":"完备化(环)","text":"完备化"}},{"Plain":",</p>\n"}]}}